const body=`Hi David,\n\nIt was good speaking with you this morning. As promised, here's some information about Saturn Star Movers for you to review and keep handy for clients and friends.\n\nWe help with residential moves across Toronto, Markham, Richmond Hill, Oakville, the wider GTA and Hamilton, as well as longer-distance moves. We've been in business for over seven years, are bonded, and carry $2 million in general liability insurance.\n\nFor pricing, we provide a binding estimate once the move details are confirmed. The amount depends on the items being moved, pickup and delivery locations, distance, stairs or elevator access, and any packing needed. The quote sets out the agreed scope and terms so your client can compare what is included. As we discussed, I'm happy to work out a client discount with you when we have the move details.\n\nHere's our Toronto digital card to save or forward:\n${card}\n\nCompany website: https://starmovers.ca\nFor a client quote: call or text 437-782-3004, or email toronto@starmovers.ca. You can also reach me on the same partnership number we spoke on, 437-465-0584.\n\nNo rush on your side. I look forward to working together when the opportunity comes up.\n\nJohn Owolabi\nSaturn Star Movers`
